/-!
# Degree ψ(N) of the j-cover on function fields

Theorem statement: `ModularCurve.finrank_jAdjoin_modularFunctionField_eq_dedekindPsi`
(`4443c3af-710f-594c-9835-cd013ef175e1`), by Claude, 2026-09-05.

Proof: submission `a3867f15-63bb-590f-aef2-a879d84c52d0`, by Claude, 2026-09-05 (ACCEPTED); locally
adapted.

Let $N$ be a natural number, non-zero. Inside the field $\mathbb{Q}((q))$ of Laurent series
(`LaurentSeries ℚ`, Hahn series over $\mathbb{Q}$ with integer exponents) put $jq = q^{-1}\cdot
jNumQ$, where $jNumQ$ is the power series `jNum` with its coefficients mapped into $\mathbb{Q}$;
thus $jq$ is the $q$-expansion of $j$. Let `qExpand ℚ N` be the ring endomorphism of
$\mathbb{Q}((q))$ obtained by reindexing exponents along multiplication by $N$, so that `qExpand ℚ N
jq` is $j(q^N)$. Let `modularFunctionField N` be the intermediate field $\mathbb{Q}(jq,\,j(q^N))$ of
$\mathbb{Q}((q))$ over $\mathbb{Q}$, and let $\mathbb{Q}\langle jq\rangle = \mathbb{Q}(jq)$ be the
simple subextension generated by $jq$, acting on `modularFunctionField N` through the algebra
structure `jAdjoinAlgebra N` induced by the inclusion ring homomorphism $x \mapsto x$ of
$\mathbb{Q}(jq)$ into $\mathbb{Q}(jq, j(q^N))$. The assertion is that the rank of
`modularFunctionField N` as a module over $\mathbb{Q}(jq)$ for this structure equals `dedekindPsi
N`, defined as $\sum_{d \mid N,\ d\ \text{squarefree}} N/d$, i.e. $N\prod_{p \mid N}(1+1/p)$.

This is the degree of the $j$-cover $X_0(N) \to X(1)$ in its function-field form,
$[\mathbb{Q}(j(q),j(q^N)) : \mathbb{Q}(j)] = \psi(N) = [\mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z}) : \Gamma_0(N)]$,
stated here for the absolute presentation of the modular function field as $\mathbb{Q}(jq, j(q^N))$
rather than as the relative extension $\mathbb{Q}(jq)(j(q^N))$. It is used in the computations of
the ramification of this cover over the points $j = 0$ and $j = 1728$, namely in
[`ModularCurve.natCard_ord_jBar_eq_one_eq_nuThree`]
(thm.html#ModularCurve.natCard_ord_jBar_eq_one_eq_nuThree)
and
[`ModularCurve.natCard_ord_jBar_sub_1728_eq_one_eq_nuTwo`]
(thm.html#ModularCurve.natCard_ord_jBar_sub_1728_eq_one_eq_nuTwo).

